-- the parameters that must be uniform in a recursive occurrence: all but the last %dnidx d, the
-- indices of a family by fording (PLAN.md revision 7.9, 6 Nov 2026, git 2ca8d747aaa5:PLAN.md, §18.12 “E28 — Elaboration”), which a recursive field gives freely
uniform-params d ps = ltake-n (%wsub (llen-w ps) (%dnidx d)) ps
